<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 5</span>: </span><span id="S6.F5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Learning curves of PCMA and baseline methods across the evaluated cooperative multi-agent tasks. Curves are averaged over 3 random seeds, and shaded regions indicate standard deviation.
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S6.T1" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S6.T1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 1</span>: </span><span id="S6.T1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Results on multi-agent tasks. Values in parentheses denote standard deviation.</span></figcaption>
<table id="S6.T1.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
