<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Detailed Proofs for Theoretical Results</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Assumptions</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We begin by restating the assumptions required for the theoretical analysis.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_assumption">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Assumption A.1</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Preference-improvement alignment)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">There exists <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> such that, for every agent <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{p}_{i}\neq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{p}_{i}\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math>, the projection of <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{b}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>b</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{b}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> onto <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{p}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{p}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is lower bounded by <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\kappa" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>κ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\kappa</annotation></semantics></math>, i.e.,</p>
<table id="A1.Ex16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex16.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\frac{\tilde{p}_{i}^{\top}\tilde{b}_{i}}{\|\tilde{p}_{i}\|_{2}^{2}}\geq\kappa,\qquad i=1,\ldots,N." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>b</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mi>κ</mi><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{\tilde{p}_{i}^{\top}\tilde{b}_{i}}{\|\tilde{p}_{i}\|_{2}^{2}}\geq\kappa,\qquad i=1,\ldots,N.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{p}_{i}:=p_{i}-\bar{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{p}_{i}:=p_{i}-\bar{p}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.Thmtheorem1.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{b}_{i}:=b_{i}-\bar{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>b</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>b</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{b}_{i}:=b_{i}-\bar{b}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_assumption">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Assumption A.2</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Attraction property near equilibrium)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\theta}(\mathbf{p})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐩</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\theta}(\mathbf{p})</annotation></semantics></math> denote a local Nash stationary solution under the preference profile <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐩</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{p}</annotation></semantics></math>. Assume that there exist <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho\in(0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho\in(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> and a neighborhood of <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\theta}(\mathbf{p})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐩</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\theta}(\mathbf{p})</annotation></semantics></math> such that</p>
<table id="A1.Ex17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\mathbf{\theta}_{\mathrm{new}}-\mathbf{\theta}(\mathbf{p})\|\leq\rho\|\mathbf{\theta}_{\mathrm{old}}-\mathbf{\theta}(\mathbf{p})\|," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>new</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐩</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>old</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐩</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\mathbf{\theta}_{\mathrm{new}}-\mathbf{\theta}(\mathbf{p})\|\leq\rho\|\mathbf{\theta}_{\mathrm{old}}-\mathbf{\theta}(\mathbf{p})\|,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.2" class="ltx_p">for all <math id="A1.Thmtheorem2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\theta}_{\mathrm{old}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>old</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\theta}_{\mathrm{old}}</annotation></semantics></math> in this neighborhood.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_assumption">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Assumption A.3</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Local Lipschitz continuity)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\theta}(\cdot):\mathcal{U}\to\Theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo rspace="0.278em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Θ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\theta}(\cdot):\mathcal{U}\to\Theta</annotation></semantics></math> be the local stationary solution mapping induced by Lemma 4.3
Assume that this mapping is Lipschitz continuous in <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{U}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{U}</annotation></semantics></math>: there
exists <math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> such that for any two preference profiles
<math id="A1.Thmtheorem3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{p},\mathbf{p}^{\prime}\in\mathcal{U}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝐩</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>𝐩</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{p},\mathbf{p}^{\prime}\in\mathcal{U}</annotation></semantics></math>,</p>
<table id="A1.Ex18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\mathbf{\theta}(\mathbf{p}^{\prime})-\mathbf{\theta}(\mathbf{p})\|\leq C\|\mathbf{p}^{\prime}-\mathbf{p}\|." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝐩</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝐩</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msup><mi>𝐩</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐩</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\mathbf{\theta}(\mathbf{p}^{\prime})-\mathbf{\theta}(\mathbf{p})\|\leq C\|\mathbf{p}^{\prime}-\mathbf{p}\|.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Proof of Theorem 4.2 in the main text</h3>

<div id="A1.Thmtheorem4" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_theorem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem A.4</span></span><span id="A1.Thmtheorem4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> </span>(Team Improvement Decomposition)<span id="A1.Thmtheorem4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For sufficiently small update step <math id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>η</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta</annotation></semantics></math>, the first-order team improvement satisfies</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex19" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="J_{\mathrm{team}}(\mathbf{\theta}_{\mathrm{new}})-J_{\mathrm{team}}(\mathbf{\theta})\geq\eta\sum_{i=1}^{N}\left\|\nabla_{\theta_{i}}J_{\mathrm{team}}(\mathbf{\theta})\right\|_{2}^{2}+\eta N\left(\bar{p}^{\top}\bar{b}+\kappa\mathcal{D}_{p}\right)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>team</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>new</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>team</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msubsup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>team</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>b</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J_{\mathrm{team}}(\mathbf{\theta}_{\mathrm{new}})-J_{\mathrm{team}}(\mathbf{\theta})\geq\eta\sum_{i=1}^{N}\left\|\nabla_{\theta_{i}}J_{\mathrm{team}}(\mathbf{\theta})\right\|_{2}^{2}+\eta N\left(\bar{p}^{\top}\bar{b}+\kappa\mathcal{D}_{p}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex20" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{p}:=\frac{1}{2N^{2}}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{j=1}^{N}\|p_{i}-p_{j}\|_{2}^{2}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{p}:=\frac{1}{2N^{2}}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\sum_{j=1}^{N}\|p_{i}-p_{j}\|_{2}^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.Thmtheorem4.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">is the pairwise preference distance across agents.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">Given preferences <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{1},\ldots,p_{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{1},\ldots,p_{N}</annotation></semantics></math>, each agent takes one gradient update</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex21" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex21.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\theta_{i,\mathrm{new}}=\theta_{i}+\eta\nabla_{\theta_{i}}U_{i}(\theta;p_{i}),\qquad i=1,\ldots,N." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>new</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>η</mi><msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{i,\mathrm{new}}=\theta_{i}+\eta\nabla_{\theta_{i}}U_{i}(\theta;p_{i}),\qquad i=1,\ldots,N.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text">where</span></p>
<table id="A1.Ex22" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U_{i}(\theta;p_{i})=J_{\mathrm{team}}(\theta)+\langle p_{i},J_{i}(\theta_{i})\rangle," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>team</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U_{i}(\theta;p_{i})=J_{\mathrm{team}}(\theta)+\langle p_{i},J_{i}(\theta_{i})\rangle,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p1.3.1" class="ltx_text">We write
<math id="A1.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{\mathrm{new}}=(\theta_{1,\mathrm{new}},\ldots,\theta_{N,\mathrm{new}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>new</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>new</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>new</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{\mathrm{new}}=(\theta_{1,\mathrm{new}},\ldots,\theta_{N,\mathrm{new}})</annotation></semantics></math>.
By the first-order Taylor expansion of <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="J_{\mathrm{team}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>team</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J_{\mathrm{team}}</annotation></semantics></math> at <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="A1.EGx1" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex23"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle J_{\mathrm{team}}(\theta_{\mathrm{new}})-J_{\mathrm{team}}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>team</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>new</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>team</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle J_{\mathrm{team}}(\theta_{\mathrm{new}})-J_{\mathrm{team}}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex23.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\eta\sum_{i=1}^{N}\left\langle\nabla_{\theta_{i}}J_{\mathrm{team}}(\theta),\nabla_{\theta_{i}}U_{i}(\theta;p_{i})\right\rangle+o(\eta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>team</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\eta\sum_{i=1}^{N}\left\langle\nabla_{\theta_{i}}J_{\mathrm{team}}(\theta),\nabla_{\theta_{i}}U_{i}(\theta;p_{i})\right\rangle+o(\eta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex24"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\eta\sum_{i=1}^{N}\left\langle\nabla_{\theta_{i}}J_{\mathrm{team}}(\theta),\nabla_{\theta_{i}}J_{\mathrm{team}}(\theta)+\nabla_{\theta_{i}}\langle p_{i},J_{i}(\theta_{i})\rangle\right\rangle+o(\eta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>team</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>team</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\eta\sum_{i=1}^{N}\left\langle\nabla_{\theta_{i}}J_{\mathrm{team}}(\theta),\nabla_{\theta_{i}}J_{\mathrm{team}}(\theta)+\nabla_{\theta_{i}}\langle p_{i},J_{i}(\theta_{i})\rangle\right\rangle+o(\eta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
